    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000u4rf](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000u4rf) Magnitude 6.2 earthquake at 136.298 depth occurred on Oct 25 2026 56km N of Luganville. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -15.0125 longitude 167.2692. It impacted 7444 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
